<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish April producer prices up 0.4 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Irish April producer prices up 0.4 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish output prices for manufacturing industries rose by 0.4 percent in April from March and were down 1.7 percent from a year ago, the Central Statistics Office said on Friday.  </p>
<p>--Dublin Newsroom +353 1 661 3377</p>
</text>
